<title>UK: Credit Local de France prices 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local de France prices 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager NatWest, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    27.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.502    PAY DATE    27.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    99.502    SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND GILT 7.0 PCT DUE 2001</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
